/*
 * Declares the CtorSymbol class.
 *
 * CtorSymbol represents the semantic information associated with a constructor
 * declaration(`CtorDecl`) inside a class. It stores the syntactic declaration,
 * the validated prototype and body, and metadata such as whether the
 * constructor is unsafe or redirects to another constructor.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::symbol::ctor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/symbol/ctor.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
